<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $1.00-1.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $1.00-1.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate. Compared with Wednesday, barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.25 lower. Top $58.25 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.00-58.25</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     57.50-58.25</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.50-57.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>		 400-450 lbs     47.50</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     50.50</p>
<p>		 550-700 lbs     52.00-53.00</p>
</text>
